  "createdAt": "2026-10-01T23:11:43.727664Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-02T02:11:56.232657Z",
  "totalBlocks": 87,
  "translatedBlocks": 87,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "464f260908fda613",
      "translationZh": "在我之前的文章《使用 Amazon S3 Vectors 为多智能体 AI 系统构建持久化记忆》中，我们探讨了为什么记忆工程是生产级多智能体系统的基础学科。我们展示了 Amazon S3 Vectors（Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 的一项功能）如何满足智能体记忆的架构需求：语义检索、丰富的元数据、强一致性和弹性扩展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76cf7dfff195b690",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将从架构转向实现。我们将向您展示如何使用 Amazon S3 Vectors 作为 NVIDIA NeMo Agent Toolkit (NAT) 内部的持久化内存层，并将其部署在 Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 上，以实现全面的运维控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fafe738da60ec6c",
      "translationZh": "读完本文后，您将了解 NAT 的内存子系统是如何工作的，以及如何将 Amazon S3 Vectors 实现为自定义内存提供程序。您还将学习如何在 Amazon EKS 上部署该技术栈，并以多智能体投资研究用例作为运行示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8c59d3c75a7a7b1e",
      "translationZh": "什么是 NVIDIA NeMo Agent Toolkit？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e219605e5abee92",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NeMo Agent Toolkit (NAT) 是一个用于构建、分析和优化 AI Agent 的开源框架。它是框架无关的，可以与 Strands Agents、LangChain、LlamaIndex、CrewAI 以及自定义实现协同工作。NAT 为生产级 Agent 系统提供了四项相关能力：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a4aa4cdecb92dd7",
      "translationZh": "智能体编排 – 将智能体定义为可组合的工作流，并配备可配置的大语言模型 (LLM)、工具和提示词。您可以使用 nat run 在本地运行它们，或者使用 nat serve 将其作为持久化服务运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a1444b4a9bb7365",
      "translationZh": "分析 – 跟踪代理和单个工具之间的令牌使用量、延迟、吞吐量和运行时间，以识别多代理工作流中的瓶颈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d222f272eda6256",
      "translationZh": "评估 – 内置评估器用于答案准确性、上下文相关性、响应基础性和代理轨迹，并支持自定义评估器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0908ed04466c4c41",
      "translationZh": "优化 – 自动化的超参数微调（temperature、top_p、max_tokens），旨在最大化质量的同时最小化成本和延迟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59fc158a506316e5",
      "translationZh": "NAT 包含一个专用的内存子系统，旨在跨智能体调用存储和检索对话历史、用户偏好以及长期知识。该内存模块是可扩展的：您可以通过实现 NAT 的插件接口来创建自定义内存提供程序（后端）。关键组件包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7e1a6794f178612",
      "translationZh": "MemoryEditor – 所有内存后端都必须实现的抽象接口。它定义了三个方法：add_items()、search() 和 remove_items()。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "749da0837cd29bf8",
      "translationZh": "MemoryItem – 代表一段内存的数据模型，包含对话历史、标签、元数据、user_id 以及可选的文本内存字符串字段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b691e48324a5cc32",
      "translationZh": "MemoryBaseConfig – 自定义内存配置所继承的 Pydantic 基类。NAT 通过其 YAML 配置中的 _type 字段来发现提供程序。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03fb43a915a8fad1",
      "translationZh": "自动内存封装 – auto_memory_agent 工作流类型，它通过自动内存捕获和检索来封装智能体，而无需 LLM 显式调用内存工具。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a75921e8b1af87e",
      "translationZh": "NAT 目前内置了这些内存提供程序：Mem0、MemMachine、Redis 和 Zep。这些涵盖了常见的使用场景。然而，对于需要弹性向量存储、强写入一致性以及向数十亿向量进行高成本效益扩展的生产级多智能体系统，由 Amazon S3 Vectors 支持的自定义提供程序才是合适的选择。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c222d599bcdbe778",
      "translationZh": "为什么选择 Amazon S3 Vectors 作为持久化内存后端",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec3183c372b9eecb",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon S3 Vectors 为多智能体 AI 系统构建持久化内存，深入探讨了架构原理。下表总结了使 S3 Vectors 成为 NAT 内存层的理想选择的特性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8eb8f31f767cbfd",
      "translationZh": "具有可配置距离度量（余弦、欧几里得）的向量相似度搜索",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c42be6a54df7db9c",
      "translationZh": "每个向量上均可过滤的元数据（字符串、数字、布尔值、列表）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b6cc082f126042b",
      "translationZh": "多智能体协作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4ed6916f08c5fed",
      "translationZh": "强写一致性。内存会在插入后立即可见",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "025137605b3a7ae8",
      "translationZh": "每个索引支持高达 20 亿个向量，无需进行容量规划",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8dc2698a9a434ac",
      "translationZh": "仅需为存储、写入和查询付费，无闲置计算成本",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2f6906877bf7df8",
      "translationZh": "针对每个存储桶和索引的 AWS 身份与访问管理 (IAM) 策略。支持实现硬隔离的租户级索引",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed94fea0de06f7ab",
      "translationZh": "要跟随本文中的实现过程，您需要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d70168f2fd533475",
      "translationZh": "一个具有创建 Amazon S3 Vectors 资源和 Amazon EKS 集群权限的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33ed1af447814174",
      "translationZh": "一个现有的 Amazon EKS 集群（参见 Amazon EKS 入门）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66e4e815fdc5721f",
      "translationZh": "已安装 NVIDIA NeMo Agent Toolkit（已在 1.6 版本上测试）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62004559f2e5cb04",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.11 或 3.12（NAT 要求 >=3.11 且 <3.14）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28ba255c2772b09e",
      "translationZh": "一个用于生成向量表示的嵌入模型（本文使用 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1dd8c12250d876e6",
      "translationZh": "用于容器和集群操作的 kubectl 和 Docker。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8fd71db36c8905a9",
      "translationZh": "将 S3 Vectors 实现为 NAT 内存提供程序",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85de244defd9f839",
      "translationZh": "实现分为三个步骤：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47d54530dcebf5e3",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：创建 S3 Vectors 基础设施",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ac9803dabea7d40",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：实现自定义 MemoryEditor 插件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45071b80630bc761",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：配置智能体工作流",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a111cbc2905d81d",
      "translationZh": "图 1：将 Amazon S3 Vectors 实现为 NAT 内存提供者的三个步骤",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9217cbe6a1240435",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1. 创建 Amazon S3 Vectors 基础设施",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b992257787b542b",
      "translationZh": "以下代码创建了一个向量存储桶（vector bucket）和一个带有专为智能体内存设计的元数据模式（metadata schema）的索引。该索引使用 1024 维以匹配 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 的输出，并将大型内容字段标记为不可过滤的元数据：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb55bdfa1e001e33",
      "translationZh": "在创建存储桶和索引后，您可以实现用于从中读取和向其写入数据的内存提供者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "743fe1aa60992594",
      "translationZh": "以下代码将 MemoryEditor 接口实现为 Amazon S3 Vectors 后端，并对其进行注册以便 NAT 可以发现它：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3248d2ea592049bd",
      "translationZh": "该插件使用 Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 生成嵌入，将每条记忆作为带有作用域元数据的向量进行存储，并将搜索过滤器转换为 Amazon S3 Vectors 元数据查询。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ff64a90c430d7762",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3. 配置 NAT 代理工作流",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08701646e435ed5d",
      "translationZh": "定义好插件后，在 NAT 的 YAML 配置中对其进行配置，并将其接入代理工作流：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "980077bf7305edac",
      "translationZh": "通过 auto_memory_agent 封装器，您可以自动捕获和检索记忆。用户消息和代理响应会被存储，并且在每次代理调用之前会注入相关的上下文。这种设计消除了让 LLM 显式调用记忆工具的需求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e71bfe8fb5d649e",
      "translationZh": "负责任的 AI 与数据处理注意事项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53d2fd99a957d664",
      "translationZh": "由于此解决方案会持久化对话历史和用户记忆，请规划如何保留和访问这些数据。为存储的记忆设置保留策略，并利用本文中的记忆合并与删除路径来使不再需要的数据过期。避免在记忆元数据中存储个人身份信息 (PII)，并在进行嵌入之前对敏感字段进行脱敏或令牌化处理。通过租户级索引和最小权限 IAM 策略来限制访问范围，确保每个代理仅能读写其拥有的记忆。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "028ce9e28a83e847",
      "translationZh": "Amazon S3 Vectors 实践：多代理投资研究",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c0319c12b53b385",
      "translationZh": "以下用例展示了这种模式在实践中的应用。考虑三个专门的代理协作开展投资研究工具：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb29cd667ce6fed1",
      "translationZh": "研究代理——收集市场数据、财报和新闻。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ef8be46e54ed088",
      "translationZh": "分析代理 – 执行定量分析并识别模式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89957888670f4fc8",
      "translationZh": "合成代理 – 生成报告，结合两个代理的发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73d40766911af906",
      "translationZh": "借助持久性内存，每个代理都能基于先前的工作进行构建。研究代理会回忆之前收集的数据，从而避免冗余的 API 调用。分析代理会基于先前会话中识别出的模式进行构建。综合代理会访问累积的发现，以生成逐步丰富的报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7cf3b2e1f69eefaa",
      "translationZh": "多智能体记忆协调",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac4c9192214d3d4a",
      "translationZh": "每个代理使用相同的 S3 Vectors 索引，但在元数据中使用自己的 agent_id 进行写入。代理通过元数据过滤器检索共享知识：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "691531273980b769",
      "translationZh": "NAT’s 内置多租户内存隔离使用 user_id 为每个用户划分内存。在多智能体团队协作中，team_id 元数据字段在同一 S3 Vectors 索引内提供了额外的分组维度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a14d0f9730d09fb2",
      "translationZh": "记忆巩固",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6bfee498d84f80b",
      "translationZh": "随着时间的推移，情境记忆会不断积累。定期将其巩固为语义记忆（概括性知识）可以保持检索的精确与高效。您可以通过计划的 cron 作业、向量计数阈值，或在配置的研究周期数之后由智能体发起的信号来触发巩固。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38d11da628d387d8",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon EKS 上部署智能体工作负载",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb57367932a5531a",
      "translationZh": "对于需要对智能体工作负载进行完全运维控制的团队来说，Amazon EKS 是一个深思熟虑的选择。通过 Amazon EKS，您可以控制扩展、网络和生命周期管理，并能与 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 原生集成，以访问 Amazon S3 Vectors。如果您更倾向于全托管运行时，Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 提供了一个托管替代方案，消除了这些运维开销。您将 NAT 智能体作为容器化服务使用 nat serve 运行。每种智能体类型都是一个 Kubernetes Deployment，并通过 IAM Roles for Service Accounts (IRSA) 授予 IAM 访问权限。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d522fe98cd3af2e5",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：构建智能体容器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b33edf83467c9333",
      "translationZh": "以下 Dockerfile 将智能体及其配置和记忆插件打包在一起：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1bf6d2773cf10fd3",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：使用 Kubernetes 清单进行部署",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11fc1ba98ffc3e22",
      "translationZh": "以下清单将部署具有自动扩展功能的 Research Agent：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3a58ce0cfcfc53f5",
      "translationZh": "用于 S3 Vectors 访问的 IAM 策略",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "195635ac45e83839",
      "translationZh": "以下 IAM 策略授予对内存层的范围访问权限。通过 IRSA 将其附加到与 agent-sa 服务帐户关联的 IAM 角色：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4488d5e6a65a1398",
      "translationZh": "构建并推送容器镜像后，部署代理：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eae00730177047ac",
      "translationZh": "S3 Vectors 提供强写一致性。Pod 和 agent 类型可以立即看到 agent Pod 存储的记忆，无需缓存失效。HorizontalPodAutoscaler 根据 CPU 利用率扩展 agent 副本。每个副本通过 IRSA 连接到同一个 S3 Vectors 索引，支持无论哪个 Pod 处理请求的一致内存访问。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cf00067208b2db59",
      "translationZh": "评估内存影响",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8a7121ecebcfc79",
      "translationZh": "使用 NAT 的评估 harness（nat eval），您可以量化记忆对代理性能的影响。配置两次评估运行：一次启用记忆，一次禁用记忆，使用相同的数据集：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e065d933a1973794",
      "translationZh": "基于此设计的架构特性，在比较这些运行时，您可以期待以下定性结果。这些是方向性期望，而不是经过基准测试的测量值：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6884d333777010f",
      "translationZh": "可靠性得到提升——回忆的记忆提供了可验证的来源上下文，智能体可以引用这些上下文，而不仅仅依赖参数知识alone。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe3ad10c750e0ca0",
      "translationZh": "Token usage 降低 – Agents 跳过重新推导已在先前会话中建立的事实。降低程度随着工作流中重复上下文的多少而变化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7db9e02ae0eb5e3d",
      "translationZh": "延迟增加适度 – 每次内存回忆会增加一个 S3 Vectors 查询（在标准访问模式下为亚秒级），通常仅占整体 LLM 推理时间的很小一部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "515b14386c10efc3",
      "translationZh": "重复工作减少 – 通过共享内存，智能体避免重复队友已经完成的研究或分析。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123268afc39e5ba9",
      "translationZh": "这些效应的大小取决于您的工作负载：跨会话重用的上下文有多少，有多少个代理在协作，以及您的检索预算（top-k）有多大。NAT 的超参数优化器可以系统地调整 top_k 和相似度阈值，以找到适用于您用例的最佳成本-质量权衡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2d484417db2ed68",
      "translationZh": "为了避免由此演练创建的资源产生持续费用，请删除以下内容：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6789fce18828f2cf",
      "translationZh": "删除 Amazon EKS 部署及其关联资源：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2d09594010189da",
      "translationZh": "删除 S3 Vectors 索引和向量存储桶:",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "057c0923240a6312",
      "translationZh": "如果不再需要，请删除为 IRSA 创建的 IAM 角色和策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e11724f27a04f2b",
      "translationZh": "本文展示了如何实现一个由 Amazon S3 Vectors 支持的自定义 NAT 内存提供程序，并将其部署在 Amazon EKS 上。其核心构建模块包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71060a96d6c4b494",
      "translationZh": "NAT 的 MemoryEditor 接口为自定义内存后端提供了插件契约。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8a1af29f6304bd7",
      "translationZh": "auto_memory_agent 封装器会自动处理捕获和检索工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "957bd308ca6ba02b",
      "translationZh": "Amazon S3 Vectors 提供具有强一致性的持久化、语义可查询后端，用于多智能体协作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57932b56b8ba352e",
      "translationZh": "Amazon EKS 让您能够完全控制智能体的生命周期、扩展和网络隔离。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1a1f6e4256c3db6",
      "translationZh": "这些模式适用于智能体能从累积知识中获益的领域。它们包括将内存分类为情节记忆、语义记忆或程序记忆，通过元数据过滤在智能体之间共享内存，以及使用大语言模型（LLM）整合内存。应用示例包括客户支持、DevOps 自动化、法律研究和科学发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5ccafbeefbe5c80",
      "translationZh": "有关本文中提到的内存架构基础，请参阅 Building persistent memory for multi-agent AI systems with Amazon S3 Vectors 。若要开始使用 NAT，请参阅 NVIDIA NeMo Agent Toolkit 文档以及 Adding a Memory Provider 指南 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
